<concept id="t00211">
	<title id="e01606">Hood open warning</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>hood 
					<indexterm>hood open warning</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>The hood warning message will appear on the LCD display when hood is open.</p>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e01607">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e01608">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV035101.eps" align="center" placement="break" id="e01609"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The warning message will appear on the LCD display when hood is open.</p>
		<p>The chime will sound if you drive with the hood opened.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>